  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 1.8,
      "text": "Huss! Huss! Huss! Huss!"
    },
    {
      "id": "2",
      "start": 1.8,
      "end": 3.5,
      "text": "Huss! Huss! Huss! Huss!"
    },
    {
      "id": "3",
      "start": 3.5,
      "end": 6.8,
      "text": "Huss! Huss! Huss! Huss! Huss!"
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "start": 6.8,
      "end": 8,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "id": "5",
      "start": 8,
      "end": 11,
      "text": "Brooo! Get in! We're going to the lake! Bro, you don't"
    },
    {
      "id": "6",
      "start": 11,
      "end": 14,
      "text": "even have a car! Stop washing that thing!"
    },
    {
      "id": "7",
      "start": 14,
      "end": 17,
      "text": "In this town, everybody loved to drive. Every single"
    },
    {
      "id": "8",
      "start": 17,
      "end": 20,
      "text": "Friday, my friends would line up, and go somewhere."
    },
    {
      "id": "9",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 22.3,
      "text": "I never had a car. I"
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "start": 22.3,
      "end": 26.5,
      "text": "had a sponge. And I had a different dream."
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "start": 26.5,
      "end": 29,
      "text": "I didn't want to drive it. I wanted to"
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "start": 29,
      "end": 32,
      "text": "be the one who makes it shine."
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "start": 32,
      "end": 34.4,
      "text": "Ahh! Almost!"
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "start": 34.4,
      "end": 36.5,
      "text": "Almost!"
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "start": 36.5,
      "end": 39,
      "text": "While my friends were out driving,"
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "start": 39,
      "end": 41,
      "text": "I was in that driveway"
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "start": 41,
      "end": 44,
      "text": "every single night. I ruined hundreds of paint jobs."
    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "start": 44,
      "end": 47,
      "text": "Went through thousands of sponges. And spent countless"
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "start": 47,
      "end": 50,
      "text": "nights, with a bucket, and a hose."
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "start": 50,
      "end": 53,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "start": 53,
      "end": 56,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "start": 56,
      "end": 59,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "id": "23",
      "start": 59,
      "end": 61,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "id": "24",
      "start": 61,
      "end": 63,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "id": "25",
      "start": 63,
      "end": 67,
      "text": "Months passed. And eventually, I was ready."
    },
    {
      "id": "26",
      "start": 67,
      "end": 70,
      "text": "One day, I finally got hired, by the biggest"
    },
    {
      "id": "27",
      "start": 70,
      "end": 72,
      "text": "dealership in town."
    },
    {
      "id": "28",
      "start": 72,
      "end": 76,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "id": "29",
      "start": 76,
      "end": 78.4,
      "text": "Wait. Is that him? Bro?! How"
    },
    {
      "id": "30",
      "start": 78.4,
      "end": 82,
      "text": "did you get so good at cars?!"
    },
    {
      "id": "31",
      "start": 82,
      "end": 85,
      "text": "Training. I've got work in the morning."
    },
    {
      "id": "32",
      "start": 85,
      "end": 88,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "id": "33",
